  (text "Power: the dev board's own USB connector. Do not inject another supply into the 3V3 pin." (at 8.89 6.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid ee1f4084-9636-4b39-8ea4-78676396d8ee)
  )
  (text "5V pin = VBUS = +5V_SPS = SPS30 VDD, always on. 3V3 pin = onboard LDO = +3V3 for U2 U3 U4 U5 and R1 R2." (at 8.89 8.89 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid dde113b1-f00b-4bbb-91a3-1d29d25c2b01)
  )
  (text "DevKitC-1 / AI-S3 silkscreen: 5V (VBUS) and 3V3 (onboard LDO)." (at 8.89 11.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9d14a34d-181d-4e92-990e-3984d2a8cc54)
  )
  (text "SDA GPIO8, SCL GPIO9. N16R8: 16 MB quad flash, 8 MB octal PSRAM." (at 8.89 13.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9c7d5f4f-9711-4035-a70b-e6b2dd6ea976)
  )
  (text "I2C is 100 kHz at 3.3 V. R1 and R2 are 4.7k to +3V3. Never pull SDA or SCL up to 5 V." (at 8.89 16.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 03ca284a-808a-4f8a-bcaf-dc593d5033dc)
  )
  (text "Fit U4 SCD30 (0x61, SEL to GND) or U5 SCD41 (0x62), not both. U6 SEL to GND selects I2C 0x69 before power-up." (at 8.89 19.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 226f5a2e-300f-485c-b092-5128f0189c51)
  )
  (text "Leave open: GPIO0/3/45/46 (strap), GPIO6, GPIO7, GPIO19/20 (USB), GPIO43/44 (UART), GPIO33-37 (octal PSRAM), GPIO48 (RGB)." (at 8.89 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 46d9ca5c-bddc-49b3-b327-2755b47b0af5)
  )

